\newlabel{fig:rgb_encoding}{{8}{12}{RGB seed-aware encoding for the \texttt {v5} pipeline. Five views per sample: composite RGB, R channel alone, G channel alone, B channel alone, and a difference channel $B - R/2 - G/2$ that visually isolates the seed.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
